  message: "Closed in PR #3861 (commit 558b81d). Audit completed across 3 PRs total: 9b63441d40 (fixture authoring + xfail for 7 non-Python languages), be0ddcb8eb (WI-tihup + WI-mafik PR2: 7-language analyzer retrofits, all original xfail stripped), 558b81d (this PR: 2 audit-extension fixtures covering idioms WI-mafik's description called out — java_wildcard FAILS → filed WI-tuhok as analyzer-fix follow-up; elixir_except PASSES → import-with-except branch confirmed). Final audit ledger: 9 idioms green, 1 xfail at WI-tuhok, no other gaps remain. The polyglot fixture is now the audit instrument going forward: adding a new construct to the fixture automatically fails CI when the analyzer misses it, so the fixture doubles as a regression boundary."  # d4cd
