  message: "Corrigendum to previous note (shell stripped backtick-wrapped code examples). The specific constructs cited: (a) Rust unresolved case: 'use bindings::docs::calculator::\\{calculate, calculate::Op\\}' followed by 'calculate::eval_expression(...)' produces no calls edge on webassembly-component-tutorial. (b) JS unresolved cases: 'import \\{ Server \\} from socketio' + 'new Server(...)' (named-import + constructor), and 'import express from express' + 'express()' (default-import + function call). Neither JS case was in WI-kujom's stated scope (aliased named imports + function call). All references to PR commits, polyglot-fixture audit, ADR-0028 in the prior note remain valid."  # 5a01
