  message: "A/B diff (2026-05-31) re-analyzed the same WI-kaziv cohort at pre-WI-mafik SHA 036e94aa20 vs HEAD 416f843499. Result: zero movement on resolved-vs-unresolved calls counts across all 6 repos (485/485 resolved, 651/651 unresolved, 1109/1109 total). dst_ref structured field: +8 on JS (socketio-chat-example), 0 on the other 5 cohort languages. The earlier discussion note's 'positive: Go aliased package imports verified working on webtunnel' is now understood differently: that resolution WAS working pre-WI-mafik too, so WI-mafik's Go contribution is orthogonal to anything webtunnel exercises. This NO_MOVE result is conclusive for this cohort but not a global refutation; the polyglot fixture (WI-pisab-furis Level 2, CI-gated) is the actual contract spec and confirms WI-mafik's per-construct claims at the unit level. No status change; WI-mafik stays done."  # 2718
